OL,3,GNEWSAThames Water reports five-borough
OL,4,Awater outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FHomes across five south London boroughs
OL,7,Fmay have no water or low pressure,
OL,8,FThames Water has said.
OL,10,FThe company said it was "aware of an
OL,11,Fissue" affecting customers in postcode
OL,12,Fareas across Kingston upon Thames,
OL,13,FMerton, Richmond upon Thames, Sutton
OL,14,Fand Wandsworth.
OL,16,FIn an update on its website at 06:45
OL,17,FBST on Monday, it said specialists were
OL,18,Fon their way to investigate the issue
OL,19,Fand work to restore the water supply.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
